From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 18:41:40 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] AMLCapture: take native screenshots

Every screenshot is tonemapped to SDR at 1080p at most, so none keeps
the output's size, 10-bit precision or HDR coding for picture analysis.
vdin1 can give the video at the output size up to 2160p in 10 bits.
